msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Look, I've been trying to reason with you, yet here you are, pretending "
"like nothing happened!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Babe, babe...! Just chill out, okay? You're takin' this way too personal. "
"Sometimes you gotta be an opportunist... make the most of those "
"opportunities! Think positive here!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"Besides, no one wants to buy cheap-ass girly shit that no one's ever heard "
"of. But did you ever listen to me? Nooo, you just went full speed ahead. "
"And now your ship has sunk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Real shame, I know, but you brought this on yourself. And, generous guy "
"that I am, I've decided to let your business live on through me... Well, at "
"least your business assets."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Now I see why you were always begging me to let you run the accounting side "
"of things..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "You were planning this from the very beginning! Weren't you!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Look, I don't have to listen to any more of your bullshit, okay!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"In fact, we're done. Right here, right now. You can't run a business to "
"save your life, and you're far from wife material... so consider yourself "
"dumped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Wh... Just like that? After all you put me through, that's how you're gonna "
"end it!? *sniffle*"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "I mean... *sob* ...I trusted you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Yeah, well, save your sob story for your hostess buddies. Maybe they'll "
"offer you a shoulder to cry on. Besides, we were already through a long "
"time ago... So bon voyage, bimbo!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Is that any way to talk to a lady?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Kiryu-san!? You came!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Huh? Who the hell is this depressed-looking motherfucker?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Let's just say I'm here to collect on Reimi's capital. Hope you don't mind "
"the intrusion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"Hahaha, don't tell me⑬you're one of Reimi's customers, aren't you? Heh, at "
"least she knows how to turn a man on... Bet she's got you wrapped around "
"her little finger, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid ""
"Keep talking like that and you'll be wrapped around a dumpster outside. I "
"guarantee it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "Oooh, is that a threat? Gee, Reimi, you really know how to choose 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"And you. You some kinda bodyguard or somethin'? Heh... It's kind of ironic, "
"you know. A bodyguard leaving here in a body bag. Hope they find one that "
"fits!"
msgstr ""

